{"seq":3,"slug":"ip-enforcement-audit","title":"执法记录审计与统计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-registry-ip-enforcement/ip-enforcement-ops/ip-enforcement-audit","wordCount":1865,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"执法记录审计与统计\">执法记录审计与统计</h1><p>IP 治理是所有风控领域里被监督得最紧的一个。权利人、卖家、监管、媒体都在看同一套机制，而他们的诉求方向相反：权利人希望看到「下架又多又快」，卖家希望看到「误杀很少、申诉有效」，监管希望看到「程序公平、有救济、无系统性滥用」。一份只报下架的统计会被另外两方立刻质疑，因此在 IP 执法里，<strong>可审计不是加分项，而是系统能否长期存在的条件</strong>。</p>\n<p>审计与统计是两件不同的事，工程实现也不同。审计回答「这一件事到底怎么发生的」，要求全链路事件留存与可回溯；统计回答「一万件事整体如何」，要求口径明确且不可被优化操纵。本篇讲两者的数据基础与典型实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-审计的最小单位是状态变更事件\">核心概念：审计的最小单位是状态变更事件</h2><p>审计最常见的实现错误是只存最终状态。一张 <code>takedown_action</code> 表上有 <code>state=&#39;applied&#39;</code>，但没人能回答：谁在什么时候把它从 <code>queued</code> 推到 <code>applied</code>、中间失败过几次、失败原因是什么、有没有人工干预过。当卖家申诉说「我的商品被下了两次」，只存终态的系统无法还原。</p>\n<p>正确做法是<strong>追加写的事件流</strong>，每一次状态变更落一条不可变事件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE ip_enforcement_event (&#10;  id            BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  occurred_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  entity_type   VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,   -- complaint|decision|takedown|&#10;                                        -- counter_notice|strike|abuse_action&#10;  entity_id     BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  event_type    VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL,   -- 如 takedown.applied / decision.overturned&#10;  actor_type    VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- system|reviewer|complainant|respondent&#10;  actor_id      BIGINT,&#10;  reason_code   VARCHAR(48),&#10;  payload       JSONB NOT NULL,&#10;  prev_state    VARCHAR(24),&#10;  next_state    VARCHAR(24)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_event_entity ON ip_enforcement_event (entity_type, entity_id, occurred_at);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_event_occurred ON ip_enforcement_event (occurred_at);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ip_enforcement_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- complaint|decision|takedown|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                        -- counter_notice|strike|abuse_action</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如 takedown.applied / decision.overturned</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actor_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- system|reviewer|complainant|respondent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actor_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payload       JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prev_state    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  next_state    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_event_entity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ip_enforcement_event (entity_type, entity_id, occurred_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_event_occurred</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ip_enforcement_event (occurred_at);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张表是只增不改的：任何状态的当前值都可以由事件流重放得到，但反过来不行。<code>prev_state</code> / <code>next_state</code> 显式成列（而不是塞进 payload）是为了让「哪些转换发生过」可以直接聚合查询——审计最常问的问题就是转换路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[投诉提交] --&gt; B[complaint.received]&#10;  B --&gt; C[complaint.validated]&#10;  C --&gt; D[decision.issued]&#10;  D --&gt;|infringing| E[takedown.queued]&#10;  D --&gt;|no_action| F[complaint.closed]&#10;  E --&gt; G[takedown.applied]&#10;  E --&gt; H[takedown.failed]&#10;  H --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; I[counter_notice.filed]&#10;  I --&gt; J{倒计时结果}&#10;  J --&gt;|未起诉| K[takedown.reverted]&#10;  J --&gt;|已起诉| L[takedown.maintained]&#10;  K --&gt; M[decision.overturned]&#10;  M --&gt; N[strike.invalidated]&#10;  G --&gt; O[strike.counted]&#10;  L --&gt; P[complaint.closed]&#10;  N --&gt; P&#10;  O --&gt; P\">graph TD\n  A[投诉提交] --&gt; B[complaint.received]\n  B --&gt; C[complaint.validated]\n  C --&gt; D[decision.issued]\n  D --&gt;|infringing| E[takedown.queued]\n  D --&gt;|no_action| F[complaint.closed]\n  E --&gt; G[takedown.applied]\n  E --&gt; H[takedown.failed]\n  H --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; I[counter_notice.filed]\n  I --&gt; J{倒计时结果}\n  J --&gt;|未起诉| K[takedown.reverted]\n  J --&gt;|已起诉| L[takedown.maintained]\n  K --&gt; M[decision.overturned]\n  M --&gt; N[strike.invalidated]\n  G --&gt; O[strike.counted]\n  L --&gt; P[complaint.closed]\n  N --&gt; P\n  O --&gt; P</pre><p>图中 <code>K → M → N</code> 这条路径是审计的重点对象：它记录了「下架被恢复 → 原判定被推翻 → 累犯计数被追溯扣除」这一完整链条。如果系统没有把这三个事件串起来（见 <a href=\"../takedown-counternotice/repeat-infringer-penalty\">重复侵权店铺处置</a> 关于追溯失效的讨论），审计就无法证明「我们已经纠正了这个错误」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"审计要能回答的四类问题\">审计要能回答的四类问题</h3><p>一份可用的审计能力，应当能直接回答下列问题，而不需要临时写脚本捞日志：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单次追溯</strong>：这次下架，从投诉到执行到恢复，每个状态变更由谁在何时依据什么触发。</li>\n<li><strong>判定输入还原</strong>：当时判定看到的证据包、权利材料、卖家信号是什么（依赖不可变证据包，见 <a href=\"../infringement-report-evidence/evidence-chain-goodfaith\">证据链与善意声明</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>人工干预可见</strong>：有没有人工覆写过自动结论，覆写人与理由是什么。</li>\n<li><strong>时序一致性</strong>：是否存在不可能的顺序（例如先恢复后下架、计数早于判定）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>后两类可以落成可直接运行的查询。人工干预可见靠 <code>actor_type=&#39;reviewer&#39;</code> 的事件；时序一致性靠对同一实体的转换顺序做校验：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 人工干预清单：哪些判定被复核员覆写过&#10;SELECT entity_id, actor_id, reason_code, occurred_at, prev_state, next_state&#10;FROM ip_enforcement_event&#10;WHERE entity_type = &#39;decision&#39; AND actor_type = &#39;reviewer&#39;&#10;  AND prev_state IS DISTINCT FROM next_state&#10;ORDER BY occurred_at DESC;&#10;&#10;-- 时序异常：同一 target 出现「先恢复后下架」或计数早于判定&#10;SELECT a.entity_id,&#10;       a.event_type AS earlier_evt, a.occurred_at AS earlier_at,&#10;       b.event_type AS later_evt,   b.occurred_at AS later_at&#10;FROM ip_enforcement_event a&#10;JOIN ip_enforcement_event b&#10;  ON a.entity_type = b.entity_type&#10; AND a.entity_id = b.entity_id&#10; AND a.occurred_at &lt; b.occurred_at&#10;WHERE a.next_state = &#39;reverted&#39; AND b.next_state = &#39;applied&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 人工干预清单：哪些判定被复核员覆写过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_id, actor_id, reason_code, occurred_at, prev_state, next_state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ip_enforcement_event</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'decision'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actor_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reviewer'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next_state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> occurred_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 时序异常：同一 target 出现「先恢复后下架」或计数早于判定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> earlier_evt, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> earlier_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> later_evt,   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> later_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ip_enforcement_event a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ip_enforcement_event b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">next_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reverted'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">next_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'applied'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后一类尤其值得做成<strong>定期自动巡检</strong>。事件流的价值之一就是让这类不一致可被机器发现——它往往指向重放、竞态或补偿逻辑的缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"统计的口径纪律\">统计的口径纪律</h2><p>统计比审计更容易被操纵，因为口径可以调。三条纪律能挡掉大部分问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第一-区分判定来源\">第一，区分判定来源</h3><p>「我们下架了多少侵权商品」这个数字，必须拆开报告它是<strong>平台自主判定</strong>、<strong>依据品牌方鉴定</strong>、还是<strong>依据监管命令</strong>。三者的责任归属完全不同：把品牌方提供结论的下架算作平台判定能力，是自证式美化。DSA Article 15 对中介服务的透明度报告明确要求区分收到的成员国当局命令数量与类型，Article 24 又要求在线平台额外披露庭外争议解决与暂停措施的数据（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=CELEX:32022R2065\">DSA Article 24</a>），其精神正是把不同来源的数字分开列示。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第二-报告分母\">第二，报告分母</h3><p>只说「下架了 120 万条」没有意义。需要同时给出：收到的投诉总数、被受理数、判定侵权数、实际下架数、被恢复数、申诉数。这些数字之间的比例才构成真实图景。一个只报下架的统计无法回答最关键的问题——<strong>判定质量如何</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第三-申诉与救济数字必须同框\">第三，申诉与救济数字必须同框</h3><p>速度和结果必须与救济一起报告，理由在 <a href=\"ip-takedown-sla-quality\">下架 SLA 与判定质量</a> 已展开：单边指标可以靠放水下架来优化。可用的同框组合是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分组</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时效</td>\n<td>各类型判定中位时长、超时率</td>\n<td>速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果</td>\n<td>下架数、驳回数，按判定来源拆分</td>\n<td>产量与来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>申诉率、申诉成功率、复犯率</td>\n<td>准确度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>救济</td>\n<td>申诉处理中位时长、庭外争议解决使用量</td>\n<td>程序可达性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滥用</td>\n<td>各类型暂停措施数量</td>\n<td>机制是否被反向利用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表就是一份可交付的执法年报骨架。它的每一行都对应第 4 章前两篇的一个度量（SLA 与质量的联合目标、滥用的处置分类），第 4.3 的职责是把它们变成能按期产出、口径稳定、可被外部复核的数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不可变性与审计的冲突处理\">不可变性与审计的冲突处理</h2><p>审计要求不可变，而运营有时需要修正（例如判定系统 bug 导致一批错误下架）。两者不能靠「允许 UPDATE 事件表」来调和——那会让审计失去意义。正确处理是<strong>修正也是事件</strong>：不修改历史事件，而是追加一条「更正事件」，并在审计视图里通过事件流推断出最终正确状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"-- 不这样做（破坏审计）&#10;UPDATE ip_enforcement_event SET next_state=&#39;no_action&#39; WHERE id=88213;&#10;&#10;-- 这样做（追加更正事件）&#10;INSERT INTO ip_enforcement_event&#10;  (occurred_at, entity_type, entity_id, event_type, actor_type, actor_id,&#10;   reason_code, payload, prev_state, next_state)&#10;VALUES&#10;  (now(), &#39;takedown&#39;, 88213, &#39;takedown.corrected_by_bugfix&#39;, &#39;system&#39;, NULL,&#10;   &#39;DECISION_ENGINE_BUG_2026_09&#39;, &#39;{&quot;batch_id&quot;:&quot;fix_20260930_01&quot;}&#39;,&#10;   &#39;applied&#39;, &#39;reverted&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 不这样做（破坏审计）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>UPDATE ip_enforcement_event SET next_state='no_action' WHERE id=88213;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 这样做（追加更正事件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>INSERT INTO ip_enforcement_event</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (occurred_at, entity_type, entity_id, event_type, actor_type, actor_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   reason_code, payload, prev_state, next_state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (now(), 'takedown', 88213, 'takedown.corrected_by_bugfix', 'system', NULL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   'DECISION_ENGINE_BUG_2026_09', '{\"batch_id\":\"fix_20260930_01\"}',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   'applied', 'reverted');</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这样处理的代价是查询复杂一点（要按事件流推导），但收益是审计链完整：任何时刻的状态都能追溯到是哪一次事件造成的，包括更正本身。</p>\n<h3 id=\"留存周期与跨境差异\">留存周期与跨境差异</h3><p>事件留存周期不能一刀切。不同法域对记录留存的要求不同，而审计与诉讼的时效也不同。工程上应当把留存策略按站点/法域配置，并且<strong>区分「可查询期」与「可归档期」</strong>——超过可查询期的事件转入冷存储，仍可被审计检索但成本更低；超过可归档期的才真正删除。删除动作本身也要留事件，否则无法证明「我们按策略删除了，而非丢失了」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>IP 治理持续处于多方反向监督之下，可审计是系统长期存在的条件，而非加分项。</li>\n<li>审计的最小单位是状态变更事件，必须追加写、不可变；只存最终状态无法还原过程。</li>\n<li>事件表要显式记录 prev_state / next_state，让转换路径可直接聚合。</li>\n<li>审计须能回答单次追溯、判定输入还原、人工干预可见、时序一致性四类问题，最后一类可做成自动巡检。</li>\n<li>统计口径三条纪律：区分判定来源、报告分母、申诉与救济数字同框。</li>\n<li>修正走追加更正事件，绝不 UPDATE 历史事件，保持审计链完整。</li>\n<li>留存策略按法域配置，区分可查询期与可归档期，删除动作本身也要留事件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"执法记录审计与统计","id":"执法记录审计与统计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：审计的最小单位是状态变更事件","id":"核心概念-审计的最小单位是状态变更事件"},{"level":3,"text":"审计要能回答的四类问题","id":"审计要能回答的四类问题"},{"level":2,"text":"统计的口径纪律","id":"统计的口径纪律"},{"level":3,"text":"第一，区分判定来源","id":"第一-区分判定来源"},{"level":3,"text":"第二，报告分母","id":"第二-报告分母"},{"level":3,"text":"第三，申诉与救济数字必须同框","id":"第三-申诉与救济数字必须同框"},{"level":2,"text":"不可变性与审计的冲突处理","id":"不可变性与审计的冲突处理"},{"level":3,"text":"留存周期与跨境差异","id":"留存周期与跨境差异"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"恶意 IP 投诉滥用防控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-registry-ip-enforcement/ip-enforcement-ops/abuse-ip-complaint-guard"},"next":null}